to realize that there's

00:12:35.749 --> 00:12:38.295
sometimes you just got
to get up and get done.

00:12:38.295 --> 00:12:41.181
That sometimes we have to pull yourself up

00:12:41.181 --> 00:12:44.325
and you have to push forward
even if you want to stay in bed.

00:12:44.325 --> 00:12:46.501
And if you don't do and you
just calling on your daddy

00:12:46.501 --> 00:12:48.003
and your daddy keeps rescuing you,

00:12:48.003 --> 00:12:49.803
you never develop those tools.

00:12:49.803 --> 00:12:52.060
You never develop that
ability to recognize what

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:54.774
you're doing wrong with your
life 'cause you're soft.

00:12:54.774 --> 00:12:56.450
You got it cushiony, you got a safety net,

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.370
a safety net for your safety net.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.164
If you had a kid, obviously
you do have a kid.

00:13:00.164 --> 00:13:01.668
