00:13:30.158 --> 00:13:32.708
things, you would get
this boost of confidence.

00:13:32.708 --> 00:13:34.539
You would get this boost of self esteem.

00:13:34.539 --> 00:13:35.874
Like whatever it is
that you're into doin'.

