00:16:15.431 --> 00:16:17.971
This is the consequences
of not feeling that

00:16:17.971 --> 00:16:19.724
awful feeling when you fail.

00:16:19.724 --> 00:16:22.889
I was talkin' to Burr a couple weeks ago.

00:16:22.889 --> 00:16:26.465
