00:19:36.831 --> 00:19:39.711
And your body is just
like what in the is this?

00:19:39.711 --> 00:19:41.879
We're supposed to be out in the fields.

00:19:41.879 --> 00:19:43.379
We're supposed to be walking up hills.

00:19:43.379 --> 00:19:45.295
We're supposed to be looking for animals

00:19:45.295 --> 00:19:48.099
or gathering vegetables,
we're supposed to be doing all

00:19:48.099 --> 00:19:50.354
these things that our
body's designed to do.

00:19:50.354 --> 00:19:53.394
We're supposed to be in
nature and nature is like a

00:19:53.394 --> 00:19:57.116
medicine, like it literally
is a medicine to you.

00:19:57.116 --> 00:20:00.382
Like people that go, you
don't have to go hunting.

00:20:00.382 --> 00:20:03.016
You don't have to go
fishing, just go hike man.

00:20:03.016 --> 00:20:05.028
Just go hike up to the top of a mountain

00:20:05.028 --> 00:20:08.279
and look out, ya know,
there's a reward that you get

00:20:08.279 --> 00:20:12.081
from that is intensely like soul filling.

00:20:12.081 --> 00:20:14.337
There's like something
about, when I was in Colorado

00:20:14.337 --> 00:20:18.353
and there was this area of
Boulder where you drive up

00:20:18.353 --> 00:20:19.901
one of these roads and there
was this area where you

00:20:19.901 --> 00:20:23.623
could park and it was
this incredible view, man.

00:20:23.623 --> 00:20:25.586
And these people just
park and just go out there

00:20:25.586 --> 00:20:27.378
and just look but you get
there and you park and you

00:20:27.378 --> 00:20:31.461
go, 'cause you would see,
you're literally seeing

00:20:32.848 --> 00:20:35.774
the Continental Divide,
these snow capped mountains

00:20:35.774 --> 00:20:38.494
in July, in July it's covered in snow

00:20:38.494 --> 00:20:39.950
'cause those mountains don't give a.

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.834
One thing that we are, we're an animal.

00:20:42.834 --> 00:20:46.691
But we're also the next
stage of animals where

00:20:46.691 --> 00:20:49.821
we're aware of who we are
and we contemplate our

00:20:49.821 --> 00:20:52.795
existence and when you
contemplate your existence

00:20:52.795 --> 00:20:54.423
and you're an intelligent
life form, you should

00:20:54.423 --> 00:20:56.341
always be seeking to improve.

00:20:56.341 --> 00:20:58.717
If you're always seeking
to improve, the thing that

00:20:58.717 --> 00:20:59.726
you look at, like what has

00:20:59.726 --> 00:21:01.520
brought me the most positive results?

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:03.442
So it's kindness, it's
kindness, it's friendship.

00:21:03.442 --> 00:21:05.950
The connection with human
beings on a very positive

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.784
level where you like build up like a trust

00:21:08.784 --> 00:21:11.796
and you have warmth and
friendship and you route

00:21:11.796 --> 00:21:14.046
for each other and you
share in each other's bounty

00:21:14.046 --> 00:21:17.766
and you build together,
that, we all know inherently

00:21:17.766 --> 00:21:20.908
in our heads that kindness
is like one of the best

00:21:20.908 --> 00:21:25.044
gifts you can bestow another
human being whether it's

00:21:25.044 --> 00:21:26.804
giving them food and they
don't have any or helping

00:21:26.804 --> 00:21:28.979
them out or hooking them up or
doing something to help 'em,

00:21:28.979 --> 00:21:32.136
just, or being around them
and complimenting them,

00:21:32.136 --> 00:21:33.971
whatever the it is, we know

00:21:33.971 --> 00:21:35.889
that inherently that feels great.

00:21:35.889 --> 00:21:38.101
We know it, we know that that's the next,

00:21:38.101 --> 00:21:40.951
we have to figure out how to
use our resources together

00:21:40.951 --> 00:21:43.129
so that we can be like that all the time.

00:21:43.129 --> 00:21:44.804
I think it's always about
doin' what you actually

00:21:44.804 --> 00:21:46.850
want to be doin' with
your life as far as if you

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:49.652
have an inner creative
expression to get out.

00:21:49.652 --> 00:21:51.364
There's a lot of people who
just always wanted to be

00:21:51.364 --> 00:21:53.750
singers and they just for
whatever reason, never pursued it.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.716
So they just sing around
